# `circuit::Circuit`

An immutable compiled circuit.

## Signature

```cpp
std::int64_t circuit::Circuit::nodes() const noexcept;
std::int64_t circuit::Circuit::unknowns() const noexcept;
std::int64_t circuit::Circuit::diodes() const noexcept;
std::int64_t circuit::Circuit::transistors() const noexcept;
std::int64_t circuit::Circuit::mosfets() const noexcept;
const std::vector<std::int64_t>& circuit::Circuit::batch_shape() const noexcept;
```

## Construction

Accessors return counts and the batch shape.

## Methods

| Method | What it does |
|---|---|
| [`nodes`](CircuitModel/nodes.md) | The number of nodes, ground included. |
| [`unknowns`](CircuitModel/unknowns.md) | The number of unknowns of the nodal equations. |
| [`diodes`](CircuitModel/diodes.md) | The number of diodes. |
| [`transistors`](CircuitModel/transistors.md) | The number of bipolar transistors. |
| [`mosfets`](CircuitModel/mosfets.md) | The number of MOSFETs. |
| [`batch_shape`](CircuitModel/batch_shape.md) | The leading batch axes of the element values. |
| [`dtype`](CircuitModel/dtype.md) | The floating dtype of the stored element values. |
| [`platform`](CircuitModel/platform.md) | The device the stored element values live on. |

## Changelog

- **0.1**: initial documented surface.

